<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: REUTER-HARVEST CONSENSUS ESTIMATES UP TO AUG 8.</title>
<headline>REUTER-HARVEST CONSENSUS ESTIMATES UP TO AUG 8.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
